shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3531920/extras/a6104774f9fecc450fff785530249ea3.avif?t=1754333222\" width=614 height=80 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Nothing is spelled out. The story in <i>Under Rooms</i> is buried in whispers, symbols, environmental details and subtle clues easily missed by the unobservant.<br>There are no clear explanations \u2014 only fragments, quiet voices, and key moments inviting you to piece it all together.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3531920/extras/4a3ebdacb5c84245b81a8135053d0337.avif?t=1754333222\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3531920/extras/34bcdcf6aabc815f76ac8f6ae8414421.avif?t=1754333222\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3531920/extras/fd9268751be800c3934c018b17711b77.avif?t=1754333222\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3531920/extras/f8d316f95aa5501e16074ae023d9f6c8.avif?t=1754333222\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3531920/extras/b0fdfd912302f6e830a1b103f452e1e8.avif?t=1754333222\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As you progress, you\u2019ll unlock unique cinematic sequences \u2014 not just cutscenes, but emotionally charged windows into the truth.<br>Each one is crafted as a vital puzzle piece, offering more than just context\u2026 they carry weight, ambiguity, and sometimes, discomfort.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Who are you? Why are you here?<br>And most of all\u2026 what are you willing to remember?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Under Rooms</i> doesn\u2019t hand you answers.<br>It dares you to find them.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Can you escape the impossible, or will you become part of this world?</strong></h2>",
    "short_description": "Under Rooms is a game of survival and exploration where reality is distorted and danger lurks around every corner. As Nick, a young man trapped in an infinite labyrinth, you must loot resources, forge alliances and confront hidden horrors. Will you escape or be lost forever?",
